curate-skills
=============

This plugin reimplements CURATE (Cutler, Kuo, Velugoti, Newhart, Figueiredo,
"CURATE: Leveraging LLM Agents to Compose, Catalog, and Deploy Reproducible
Workflows", arXiv:2608.04270) as Claude Code skills.

Parts of this plugin are derived from the CURATE prototype:
  https://github.com/nolcut/CURATE-prototype
  commit 3fd5c16092ddf97a28bc3b83088e23e7f1b0f140

- Vendored code: the scripts listed in scripts/VENDORED.md (FaaSr JSON
  emitter/validator, BM25 catalog search, catalog write, FaaSr local stubs).
- Adapted prompt text: the skill and agent instruction files listed in the
  "Adapted prompt text" table of scripts/VENDORED.md.

